title: 'Asset Hub Westend and staking-async parachain: send XCM fees to the DAP staging account'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The Asset Hub Westend and staking-async parachain XCM fee managers currently send fees to the
    `pallet-dap` staging account instead of the DAP buffer account. `pallet-dap` drains the
    staging account into the buffer in `on_idle` and deactivates the drained amount, so XCM fees
    in the buffer count as inactive issuance like the other DAP inflows.

    Fix the issue, replacing in both runtimes `xcm_config::DapBufferAccount` with `xcm_config::DapStagingAccount`.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: major
- name: pallet-staking-async-parachain-runtime
  bump: major
